  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quand il noue sa ceinture, il devient\nplus puissant. Les Judokrak sauvages\ntressent leur ceinture avec des lianes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When it tightens its belt, it becomes\nstronger. Wild Throh use vines to weave\ntheir own belts.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ils aiment projeter ceux qui sont plus\ngrands qu’eux. On les trouve toujours\npar groupes de cinq.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When they encounter foes bigger than\nthemselves, they try to throw them.\nThey always travel in packs of five.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When it encounters a foe bigger than\nitself, it wants to throw it.\nIt changes belts as it gets stronger.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/21/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When it encounters a foe bigger than\nitself, it wants to throw it.\nIt changes belts as it gets stronger.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "おびを　しめると　パワーアップする。\nやせいの　ナゲキは　つるくさを\nあんで　じぶんの　おびを　つくる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "끈을 매면 파워가 올라간다.\n야생 던지미는 덩굴풀을 엮어\n자신의 띠를 만든다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quand il noue sa ceinture, il devient plus puissant.\nLes Judokrak sauvages tressent leur ceinture avec\ndes lianes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Zurrt es seinen Gürtel fest, gewinnt es an Kraft.\nWilde Exemplare flechten sich ihren Gürtel\nin Handarbeit aus Ranken.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Aumenta su potencia si se aprieta el cinturón. Un\nThroh salvaje teje su propio cinturón usando lianas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La cintura da karate lo rende più forte. I Throh\nselvatici si costruiscono le cinture usando piante\nrampicanti.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When it tightens its belt, it becomes stronger. Wild\nThroh use vines to weave their own belts.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "帯を　締めると　パワーアップする。\n野生の　ナゲキは　つる草を　編んで\n自分の　帯を　作る。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Aumenta su potencia si se aprieta el cinturón. Un\nThroh salvaje teje su propio cinturón usando lianas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "じぶんより　おおきな　あいてと\nであうと　むしょうに　なげたくなる。\nつよくなると　おびを　とりかえる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "자신보다 큰 상대와 만나면\n이유 없이 내던지고 싶어 한다.\n강해지면 띠를 바꾼다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ils aiment projeter ceux qui sont plus grands qu’eux.\nIls changent de ceinture quand ils progressent.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Trifft es jemanden, der größer ist als es selbst,\nwill es ihn unbedingt werfen. Wird es stärker,\nwechselt es den Gürtel.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si se topa con un rival más fuerte, ansía lanzarlo por\nlos aires. Al hacerse más fuerte, cambia su cinturón.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quando incontra un avversario più grande di lui, lo\nassale l’istinto di lanciarlo via. Cambia cintura quando\ndiventa più forte.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When it encounters a foe bigger than itself, it wants\nto throw it. It changes belts as it gets stronger.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
