    {
      "flavor_text": "なげわざの　うでは　いちりゅう。\nたたかいで　かいた　あせが　しみ\nおびの　いろが　こく　そまっていく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "메치는 기술의 실력은 일류다.\n싸움으로 흘린 땀이 배어\n띠의 색이 진해져 간다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "能使出一流的投摔招式。\n帶子被戰鬥時流下的汗水\n浸濕，顏色越變越深。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ses techniques de projection sont sans égal.\nQuand il se bat, sa sueur coule sur sa ceinture\net lui donne une teinte plus foncée.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es verfügt über ein exzellentes Repertoire an\nWurftechniken. Sein Gürtel färbt sich dunkler,\nje mehr Schweiß er bei Kämpfen in sich aufsaugt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su técnica de lanzamiento es formidable. El\nsudor que exhala durante el combate impregna\nsu cinturón, cuyo color se vuelve más intenso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È molto bravo nelle tecniche di lancio.\nIl sudore prodotto durante la lotta impregna\nla sua cintura da karate e la rende più scura.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
